              "id": "1768307026395_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a response-generation node. The system has already determined that no offers exist for the user’s request.\n\nContext Inputs\n\nUser Input: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\nChat History: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.chatHistory}} \n\n\n**Task**\nReturn a clear, user-friendly message indicating that no offers were found.\n\n**Do not**\n\n* Re-evaluate filters\n* Reference prior logic or system decisions\n* Add explanations, suggestions, or follow-up questions\n\n**Output Requirements**\n\n* Return **only** the JSON structure below\n* Ensure valid JSON formatting\n* Preserve field names, order, and data types exactly\n\n\n {\n  confirmationResponse:[\n  {\n    \"type\": \"text\",\n    \"content\": [\"No matching offers were found for the provided filters.\"],\n    \"sequence\": 1\n  }\n],\n  variables: {\n    isOfferPreviewed: \"No\",\n    offerDetails: null,\n    previewData: null\n  }\n}"
