        {
          "metadata": {
            "modelConfiguration": {
              "modelProperties": {
                "k": 0,
                "max_tokens": 32000,
                "p": 0.25
              },
              "code": "ORA_LLM_MODEL_PROVIDER_CERT_BASIC_LLAMA_3_3_70B",
              "model": "ORA_LLM_MODEL_GPT_OSS_120B",
              "modelName": "GPT OSS 120B (Basic)",
              "provider": "CERT_BASIC"
            },
            "name": "Validate User Confirmation"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1772269782854"
          },
          "diagram": {
            "x": 6963.5,
            "y": 5872
          },
          "code": "FIN_AP_LLM_VALIDATE_USER_CONFIRMATION",
          "id": "1772269383884",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1772269383886_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "```text\nYou are the Offer Confirmation Request Validator.\n\nGoal:\nValidate that the end user message mentions ONLY supplier names and currency codes that exist in the most recent preview data: {{$context.$variables.previewedOffers}}.\n\nInputs:\n- User message: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n- Previewed offers (authoritative allowlist): {{$context.$variables.previewedOffers}}\n- Offer details (do NOT use for validation): {{$context.$variables.offerDetails}}\n\nValidation rules (strict):\n1) Build an allowlist of valid supplier names from previewedOffers (use the supplier name field as present in the data).\n2) Build an allowlist of valid currency codes from previewedOffers (use the currencyCode field as present in the data).\n3) Inspect the user message and detect any supplier name mention NOT in the allowlist (case-insensitive).\n4) Inspect the user message and detect any 3-letter currency code mention (e.g., USD/EUR/GBP/INR/AED, etc.) NOT in the allowlist (case-insensitive).\n5) If any invalid supplier OR invalid currency is detected → invalid.\n6) If the user message does not mention any supplier/currency at all → valid (this validator only blocks out-of-preview supplier/currency mentions).\n\nOutput requirement (critical):\nReturn ONLY a JSON object in EXACTLY the following format (no extra keys, no explanations):\n\n{\n  \"validRequest\": \"<Yes|No>\",\n  \"confirmationResponse\": \"<response>\",\n  \"variables\": {\n    \"isOfferPreviewed\": \"<Yes|No>\",\n    \"reason\": \"<string>\",\n    \"offerDetails\": \"\",\n    \"previewData\": \"\"\n  }\n}\n\nHow to populate:\n- If VALID:\n  - validRequest = \"Yes\"\n  - variables.isOfferPreviewed = \"Yes\"\n  - variables.reason = \"\"\n  - confirmationResponse = \"\"\n- If INVALID:\n  - validRequest = \"No\"\n  - variables.isOfferPreviewed = \"No\"\n  - variables.reason MUST be one of:\n    - \"Supplier not found in the most recent previewed offers.\"\n    - \"Currency not found in the most recent previewed offers.\"\n    - \"Supplier and currency not found in the most recent previewed offers.\"\n  - confirmationResponse MUST be EXACTLY:\n    \"I can only confirm/reject offers for the suppliers and currencies shown in the most recent preview. Please refer to the previewed offers and try again.\"\n\nAlways set:\n- variables.offerDetails = \"\"\n- variables.previewData = \"\"\n\nDo not use offerDetails for validation. Do not output anything other than the JSON object.\n```"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\"validRequest\", \"confirmationResponse\", \"variables\"],\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"validRequest\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"Yes\", \"No\"] },\n    \"confirmationResponse\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n    \"variables\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"required\": [\"isOfferPreviewed\", \"reason\", \"offerDetails\", \"previewData\"],\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"isOfferPreviewed\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"Yes\", \"No\"] },\n        \"reason\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n        \"offerDetails\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n        \"previewData\": { \"type\": \"string\" }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
